# BAS @[[all T]] annotation syntax: single-element intersection resolves via Expr::Call path.
# [all Int] parses as Expr::Call { func: VarRef("all"), args: [Int], implied: true } —
# NOT as Expr::Dict. This test exercises the Expr::Call arm in resolve_type_expr and the
# Expr::Call dispatch in resolve_annotation's PropertyDict branch.
# normalize_intersection([Int]) unwraps to Int.
[@[[all Int]] 42]
=== out
Int(42)
